      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\"><span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span><span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Linked list re-linking</span><a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/rotate-list/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 61</a></div>\n  <h1>Rotate List</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Insight in one line: rotating right by k only moves the last k % len nodes to the front, so count the length while finding the tail, join the tail to the head to make a ring, and cut the ring after node len - k. Two walks, O(n) time, O(1) space.</p>\n"
